                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Even though its from 1998, the game is still great fun to play and im impressed by how well its stood the test of time, the campaign is excellent, the combat is fun and the level design is probably one of the game’s best features, i really like how the story unfolds during the gameplay itself, without having to stop all the time to watch cutscenes, the atmosphere at black mesa is also excellent and makes the campaign much more immersive, some parts may seem a bit dated today, and there are a few mechanics that take a while to get used to, but nothing that spoils the experience.",
